WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.109 --> 00:00:06.091
- [Narrator] Beneath the
streets of Stockholm, Sweden,

00:00:06.091 --> 00:00:08.400
is the world's longest art gallery.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.611
A 68 mile cavern of culture,

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:13.416
exhibiting over 150 artists.

00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:15.387
It also happens to be a metro system

00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:17.918
that carries nearly a million riders a day

00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:21.486
turning the morning commute
into something truly inspiring.

00:00:21.486 --> 00:00:24.486
(electronic music)

